---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>🧑‍🚀 Welcome to My Corner of the Internet</h1>
			<p>
				Hi, I'm Shalonda, a healthcare operations professional, systems enthusiast,
				military spouse, and mom passionat about building smarter workflows,
				sustainable growth, and a more intentional life.
			</p>
			<p>
				This space was created to document my journey through healthcare operations,
				process improvement, productivity systems, career growth, and the lessons
				I'm learning along the way.
			</p>
			<p>Here you'll find content focused on:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>healthcare operations and workflow insights</li>
				<li>Process improvement and organization systems</li>
				<li>Remote career growth and professional development</li>
				<li>Productivity tools like Notion, Excel, and automation</li>
				<li>Personal growth, financial rebuilding, and intentional living</li>
			</ul>

			<blockquote>
			To help people create systems that reduce chaos, improve efficiency,
			and support long-term growth in both life and work.
			</blockquote>
			<p>
				Whether you're exploring healthcare careers, building better routines,
				improving workflows, or simply trying to create more structure in your
				daily life... WELCOME. I'm glad you're here!
			</p>
			<p>
				Looking for a blog template with a bit more personality? Check out
				<a href="https://github.com/Charca/astro-blog-template">astro-blog-template</a>
				by <a href="https://twitter.com/Charca">Maxi Ferreira</a>.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
